  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 202.01 Hearings: When Held. The department shall conduct a hearing:\n\n(a) As required by RSA 482-A:8, for any project that:\n\n(1) Would have a significant environmental impact, as defined in Env-Wt 104, on the resources protected by RSA 482-A; or\n\n(2) Is of substantial public interest, as defined in Env-Wt 104.\n\n(b) As required by RSA 482-A:17, RSA 482-A:22, and RSA 482-A:22-a.\n\nSource. #2271, eff 1-10-83; ss by #2924, eff 12-11-84; ss by #4585, eff 3-8-89; ss by #5028, eff 12-20-90; ss by #6404, INTERIM, eff 12-21-96, EXPIRED: 4-20-97\n\nNew. #6498-B, eff 4-23-97, EXPIRED: 4-23-05\n\nNew. #8341, eff 4-25-05 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 200); ss by #10366-A, eff 6-26-13; ss by #12802, eff 12-15-19 (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 200); ss by #13948, eff 4-30-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt200.html"
